  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Installing the IMPALA monitoring system at St Luke&apos;s</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to demonstrate that GOAL 3 can effectively install the Impala Monitoring system at St Luke&apos;s hospital in Malawi.The Monitoring system has been developed for low resource settings. With the system health professionals can diagnose critical illnesses in newborns earlier and better.GOAL 3&apos;s implementation service includes the device, training, and use support to improve the clinical care processes in the High Dependency units.</narrative>
  </description>
